    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randall the Grape Jelly Cube looking thing is going on a quest in Soda Valley to take revenge on the monsters that lurk in the valley (or maybe he is just really bored; no one really knows for sure). Kick your way through one giant valley with different areas to explore, different collectibles to pick up, and a few secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex movement mechanics that allow the player to flow through levels once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant level with secret areas and a total of 12 collectible crystals to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A castle dungeon area that has a boss fight at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cartoony aesthetic with cel-shading and outlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique music tracks, one of which contains live instruments.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randall the Grape Jelly Cube looking thing is going on a quest in Soda Valley to take revenge on the monsters that lurk in the valley (or maybe he is just really bored; no one really knows for sure). Kick your way through one giant valley with different areas to explore, different collectibles to pick up, and a few secrets to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex movement mechanics that allow the player to flow through levels once mastered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A giant level with secret areas and a total of 12 collectible crystals to find</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A castle dungeon area that has a boss fight at the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cartoony aesthetic with cel-shading and outlines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique music tracks, one of which contains live instruments.</p></li></ul>",
